From a2f33219ba2d0be438c061293560c51ee850777e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:59:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] logger: --can-tx / --can-tx-ids (v1e PT-CAN TX), cantx:
 status line; run.sh ptcan tests

- --can-tx = all emulated IDs, --can-tx-ids hex IDs and/or sets step1..step5, dde,
  egs, all; implies --can. Clear, then mask; keepalive every 2 s; TX off first on
  exit / Ctrl-C / error. Refused by firmware without 0xa5 -> error exit.
- frts: REQ 0xa5/0xa6, CANTX_IDS (= firmware table order), ptcan_stats_t parser
- tests: fake-USB logger flow, stats layout C vs frts.py, ptcan replays in run.sh
---
 tests/host/run.sh                |  35 +++++++++
 tests/host/test_cantx_logger.py  | 117 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/ts_capture/fr_ts_logger.py | 100 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 tools/ts_capture/frts.py         |  97 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 343 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/host/test_cantx_logger.py

